{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3247","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3247/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3247/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3247/events","html_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3247","id":3733757095,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAzJbyc65GVL-","number":3247,"title":"cli: add rg-gen binary for cross-compilation doc generation","user":{"login":"OctopusET","id":18513799,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTEzNzk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18513799?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET","html_url":"https://github.com/OctopusET","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OctopusET/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-12-16T08:36:13Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T14:14:30Z","closed_at":"2025-12-16T14:10:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pulls/3247","html_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3247","diff_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3247.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3247.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"When cross-compiling ripgrep, distributions need to generate man pages and shell completions. Currently this requires running the target binary, which is not possible on the host machine.\r\n\r\nFor example, Gentoo's ebuild does this at install time:\r\nhttps://github.com/gentoo/gentoo/blob/master/sys-apps/ripgrep/ripgrep-15.1.0.ebuild#L105\r\n\r\nThis fails during cross-compilation because rg is built for target, not host:\r\n```sh\r\n$(cargo_target_dir)/rg --generate man\r\n```\r\n\r\n### This PR adds rg-gen, a minimal binary that only generates docs:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n# Build minimal generator for host\r\ncargo build --bin rg-gen --no-default-features\r\n\r\n# Or use the cargo alias\r\ncargo rg-gen\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n# Generate docs\r\n./rg-gen man > rg.1\r\n./rg-gen complete-bash > rg.bash\r\n./rg-gen complete-zsh > _rg\r\n./rg-gen complete-fish > rg.fish\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Add `cli` feature to gate CLI-only modules\r\n- Add `rg-gen` binary that shares code with `rg`\r\n- Add cargo alias for convenience\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\n- `cargo run` still runs `rg` by default\r\n- All existing tests pass\r\n- Output is identical to `rg --generate`\r\n- https://github.com/OctopusET/ripgrep/tree/rg-gen-crate different approach using separate crate\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"BurntSushi","id":456674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjY3NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/456674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi","html_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurntSushi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3247/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}